$ gragas cache --help
--- stdout

  What gragas keeps on this machine,
  outside any project:
  the copies of what a run replaced and
  the runs they belong
  to, and the caches that later commands
  fill. Nothing in it
  carries a project's name.

    gragas cache list
    gragas cache clear --apply

  USAGE


    gragas cache [command] [--flags]


  COMMANDS

    clear [--flags]  Remove the closed
                     runs kept longer
                     than the keep age,
                     the scratch folders
                     a stopped run left
                     and the tools'
                     caches
    list             List what is kept,
                     how big and how old

  FLAGS

    --accessible     Plain questions
                     (ACCESSIBLE)
    --config         The settings file
                     (GRAGAS_CONFIG)
    -h --help        Help for cache
    --json           Answer in one JSON
                     document
    --no-color       No colour
                     (NO_COLOR)
    --plain          Print plainly:
                     nothing moves

--- stderr
